   103 5625			 .local P
   104 5625			 icl 'word/page.inc'
Source: page.inc
     1 				; PAGE mode (hmode = 4): a true-width page view. The editing engine is the normal one (insert, delete,
     2 				; reflow, cursor keys); only the drawing differs. The page is up to 144 columns of 4 px cells with the
     3 				; 12-row Craft cell (2 headroom rows, cap line, baseline, 3 descender rows), so lines advance 12 scanlines.
     4 				; Paper columns are scrolled horizontally to follow the cursor. Docs: docs/ACWRITER-PAGE.md.
     5
