     2 				; to 16x16 cells, 20 columns by 9 lines, scrolled sideways (pwx) to follow the cursor. The editing engine is the
     3 				; normal one; pzmain replaces pwmain while pzoom = 1. Style codes are not drawn (plain glyphs). docs/ACWRITER-PAGE.md.
